{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqqy7diwrc6","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"daemon event loop wedge from synchronous git worktree add","summary":"Root cause of the reported daemon \"wedge\" (GET /health times out, requests hang past their socket timeout) during subconscious assignment prepare, branch_task, attempt/feature merge, and the automode judge merge: lib/git.js ran every git command via execFileSync on the daemon's single event-loop thread. Measured on this repo (124 worktrees): `git worktree add` ~5.5s, `git worktree remove` ~2s, `git status` ~0.15s. For the whole duration of a worktree add the daemon serviced NO request, /health included — that is the wedge. It is NOT the search-context agentic path: 8 back-to-back search-context calls with no prepare kept the loop healthy (event-loop lag under 1.1s); an in-process probe showed 6.5-7.4s event-loop stalls 1:1 with each prepare's worktree add. Fix (branch worktree-fix-daemon-sync-git-wedge): added async execFile variants to lib/git.js (createWorktreeAsync, removeWorktreeAsync, mergeBranchAsync, createFeatureWorktreeAsync, mergeFeatureAsync, attemptDiffAsync, initRepoAsync, isRepoAsync, listWorktreesAsync) and made the already-async route handlers in routes/git.js, routes/task.js, routes/subconscious.js, routes/overlay.js await them; sync versions kept verbatim for CLI/tests. After the fix /health stays p50=4ms max=9ms while a 6s worktree add runs concurrently. Two secondary fixes in the same branch: search-context rebuilt the whole graph once PER agentic round because the daemon ctx exposed no readGraphSnapshot — added an overlay-mtime-cached readGraphSnapshot so the graph builds once per request (measured search latency climb 0.5s to 2.2s); and rerank/embed cold-start spawned duplicate sidecars (observed 3 rerank sidecars) because the _spawning flag clears before the child binds its socket — added a 15s spawn cooldown.","category":null,"tags":["daemon","git","event-loop","performance","worktree","wedge","search-context"],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-23T17:58:42.488Z","vec":[-0.05515403300523758,-0.036723531782627106,-0.009780979715287685,0.05176695063710213,0.028759455308318138,-0.11959392577409744,-0.0706540048122406,0.03808411955833435,0.04525415226817131,0.017809003591537476,0.013130184262990952,0.038398582488298416,0.01339272316545248,-0.048006877303123474,0.020622696727514267,-0.025623293593525887,0.01958947628736496,0.03490671142935753,-0.02254302240908146,-0.030103979632258415,-0.03809395432472229,0.01379848551005125,0.033892180770635605,-0.0019703954458236694,0.01578378863632679,-0.0493113175034523,-0.1303490847349167,-0.10619670152664185,-0.044273216277360916,0.0057228910736739635,0.011538789607584476,-0.013980232179164886,-0.061003684997558594,0.05507228150963783,0.02658051997423172,0.1038946583867073,-0.0036131665110588074,-0.037372831255197525,-0.0761486142873764,0.006537178531289101,0.055026452988386154,0.07182864844799042,-0.027884045615792274,-0.02359735034406185,-0.009408620186150074,-0.039237432181835175,-0.10297666490077972,-0.057245198637247086,-0.028565458953380585,-0.023542653769254684,-0.063173308968544,-0.03786027431488037,-0.023805763572454453,0.0052827391773462296,0.08858009427785873,0.04907495528459549,0.046814605593681335,0.0411229282617569,-0.005273373797535896,0.029664158821105957,0.05753685534000397,0.015643004328012466,-0.06966938823461533,-0.040684446692466736,0.06551513075828552,0.020466908812522888,0.039089079946279526,-0.013066419400274754,0.0766221210360527,-0.02246246486902237,0.048888225108385086,0.029460787773132324,-0.09521248191595078,-0.053475428372621536,0.0014752569841220975,0.04493250325322151,-0.012474722228944302,0.012661866843700409,-0.057597897946834564,-0.10953504592180252,-0.06718095391988754,0.0009627066901884973,-0.003696287516504526,-0.00401088735088706,-0.01933114416897297,0.0025129620917141438,0.042304638773202896,0.045933280140161514,0.08907609432935715,0.00732343690469861,0.031334489583969116,-